The **[[obj:musculartriangle]]** is outlined by:

- the **[[obj:hyoidbone]]** superiorly [1];
- the superior belly of the **[[obj:omohyoidmuscle]]** [1];
- the anterior border of the **[[obj:sternocleidomastoidmuscle]]** laterally [1];
- the midline [1].

These boundaries place it between the **[[obj:hyoidbone]]**, the **[[obj:omohyoidmuscle]]**, the **[[obj:sternocleidomastoidmuscle]]**, and the midline [1].

